<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns first credit at 34.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns first credit at 34.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has placed the first of three credits whereby it sought to inject 2.961 billion pesos in the secondary market on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The credits were offered or assigned as follows:</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS	TERM	  MAX	MIN    AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>987   million pesos  112 days   34.02    33.97    34.00    5    2</p>
<p>987   million pesos   6 days</p>
<p>987   million pesos   1 days</p>
<p>NOTE: The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
